If you subscribe to Adobe Creative Cloud, here&rsquo;s how you can get two months free at this time:
petapixel.com/2020/03/1&hellip;
It worked for me.

I&rsquo;m working on an iOS app to batch upload photos to your Micro.blog hosted site. If you&rsquo;d like to check it out, here&rsquo;s the TestFlight invite: testflight.apple.com/join/Abjt&hellip;
Let me know what you think :-)
Update (3rd Feb): I&rsquo;ve increased the limit on the beta, so please try again in case you missed it before.

&ldquo;What app should I use to find my friends?&rdquo;
&ldquo;Find My app&rdquo;
&ldquo;I don&rsquo;t want to find apps. I want to find my friends.&rdquo;
&ldquo;Yea, for that you need Find My app.&rdquo;
&ldquo;Oh, so it helps you find your friends as well as your apps?&rdquo;
&ldquo;No, but it does help you find your devices.&rdquo;
